        version={"label": "Modified Tardieu Scale (Boyd & Graham 1999)", "detail": "Quality of muscle reaction X (0–5) at a stated velocity; R1 = angle of catch after a fast stretch (V2 or V3); R2 = passive range after a slow stretch (V1). The dynamic component is the difference between R2 and R1."},
